<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a Programmer Analyst for Enterprise Applications at North Park
      University in Chicago, IL. I design, develop, and maintain software
      applications based on system and business requirements. These applications
      include custom web UIs, data pipelines, reporting tools, and more. In
      short, I work closely with functional/end users to understand business
      needs and then translate them into technical solutions.
    </p>
    <p>
      When I'm not at work, I'm probably hanging out with <a
        target="_blank"
        href="https://victoriagerman.com">my lovely wife</a
      > and/or my two daughters. I also enjoy cosplaying as a sysadmin in
      my <a href="https://github.com/dominicgerman/homelab" target="_blank">homelab</a
      > and singing in classical music ensembles.
      As a singer, I specialize in choral music and have made two GRAMMY
      award-winning albums with the professional chamber choir The Crossing.
    </p>
    <p>
      <img src="/dom_mirror_small.jpg" alt="A handsome motherfucker." />
      (Wedding day photo)
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

